  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A kayak is moving perpendicularly to ocean waves that are travelling at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> towards the coast. The waves arrive at the coast with a frequency of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.40\"></span> Hz. The person sitting in the kayak observes that the kayak crosses the wavefronts with a frequency of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.20\"></span> Hz.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>In which direction is the kayak moving and what is the speed of the kayak?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction in which the kayak is moving</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Speed of the kayak</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards the coast</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards the coast</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from the coast</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from the coast</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
